  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place vinegar and sugar in a saucepan; cook and stir over medium heat until sugar has dissolved and mixture comes to a boil. Add jalapeños, carrots, and onion. Remove pan from the heat and let stand for 1 hour. Cool to room temperature before serving.",
